		{
			title = "In These Days",
			text = [=[The talk of the inn is of lost wells, bounties on nomads and strange bugs in the west. Scholars come to buy what the goblins know. Smiths come for {link:krinkle-goodsteel}Krinkle Goodsteel{/link}'s molds, and the cloth merchant {link:vizzklick}Vizzklick{/link} still rejoices at the death of {link:trade-master-kovic}Trade Master Kovic{/link}.]=],
		},
	},
